<title>USA: Itasca County, Minn., schools won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Itasca County, Minn., schools won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Monday it won $27.6 million Independent School District No 318, Itasca County, Minn., bonds at a true interest cost of 5.20 percent.</p>
<p>AMT: 27,565,000     DATE: 12/16/96	NYC Time: 1200     CUSIP: 386352</p>
<p>ISSUER: Grand Rapids Ind Sch Dist 318			    ST: MN</p>
<p>ISSUE: G.O. school building Series 1996			  TAX STAT: Exempt-ULT</p>
<p>M/SP/F: Aa1/NA/NA							BOOK ENTRY: Y</p>
<p>ENHANCEMENTS: MBIA/Aaa/AAA/NA					BANK QUAL: N</p>
<p>DTD: 12/01/96							    SURE BID: Y</p>
<p>DUE: 2/1/00-12						SR MGR: PaineWebber Inc.</p>
<p>1ST CPN: 08/01/97					   DOLLAR BID: 98.6254</p>
<p>CALL: 2/1/05 @ par					  TIC 5.20</p>
<p>DELIVERY: 40 days					   ORDERS: 1 HR</p>
<p>PAYING AGENT: First Trust N.A., St. Paul</p>
<p>L.O.: Knutson, Flynn, Hetland, Deans &amp; Olsen, St. Paul</p>
<p>F.A.: Ehlers &amp; Associates, Minneapolis</p>
